    advantages: ['Simple 2-FF/3-FF primitive for 1-bit level signals', 'Guaranteed metastability isolation when rules are followed'],
    limitations: ['NEVER synchronize multi-bit binary counters with parallel 2-FFs (different bits resolve on different cycles -> garbage intermediate codes!).'],
