    archSummary: 'Synthesis inserts `ISO_AND` (`clamp 0`) or `ISO_OR` (`clamp 1`) standard cells on outputs of switchable domains powered by Always-On rail.',
    clockAndReset: 'PMU enforces strict order: Quiesce Bus -> Assert `iso_en=1` -> Drop Power Switch. Wake-up: Restore Power Switch -> Assert Reset -> Release `iso_en=0`.',
